        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jude Law, Matt Damon, Marion Cotillard, Bryan Cranston, Laurence Fishburne, Gwyneth Paltrow, Kate Winslet, Jennifer Ehle, David Jude Heyworth Law, Robert Downey Jr., Scott Z. Burns\n- Works: Contagion, Sherlock Holmes\n- Roles: Sherlock Holmes, Dr. John Watson\n\nFacts:\n- David Jude Heyworth Law was born on 29 December 1972 and is an English actor.\n- Scott Z. Burns wrote the 2011 film Contagion, which features Matt Damon.\n- The film Contagion has an ensemble cast that includes Marion Cotillard, Bryan Cranston, Matt Damon, Laurence Fishburne, Jude Law, Gwyneth Paltrow, Kate Winslet, and Jennifer Ehle.\n- In the 2009 film Sherlock Holmes, Robert Downey Jr. portrays Sherlock Holmes and Jude Law portrays Dr. John Watson.",
